  "prefLabel": "Soil 103.03 The Chairperson and Vice Chairperson",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Soil 103.03 The Chairperson and Vice Chairperson. The chairperson shall preside at all meetings. In the absence of the chairperson, the vice-chairperson shall preside.\n\nSource. #6231, eff 4-26-96; ss by #8006, eff 12-18-03; ss by #14535, eff 4-1-26",
